* Tag to be voted upon (off 4.3 branch) is the 4.3.1 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/4.3.1-rc1

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/documentation.html

* Protocol:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/design/protocol

* Successful CI builds for the 4.3 branch:
Unit/integration tests:
